  m_Name: Snow_Cabin_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Snow_Cabin_3
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 3"
  content: "\tWhen the brief summer comes, the permafrost surface melts into a shallow
    layer of wet mud \u2014 but the water can't drain because the frozen layer beneath
    blocks it. Trees that try to grow here face root rot, or else they're toppled
    by high winds because their roots can never go deep enough. The plants here have
    grown wise: they press themselves flat against the ground, hoarding warmth, hiding
    from the wind above."
  type: 0
  biome: 2
